# Estado
101/101 tareas (100%) | iOS: 100% ✅ | MVP: 100% ✅ | Seguridad: 100% (JWT+cookies+OWASP) ✅ | SESSION: 100% ✅ | EMAIL: 100% ✅ | NOTIFICATIONS: 100% ✅ | CLIENT-UI: 100% ✅ | PASSWORD: 100% ✅

# Stack
**Backend:** Node.js + Express + TypeScript + Prisma + Passport JWT + bcrypt + Pino + Nodemailer 7.0.9
**Frontend:** React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + TailwindCSS 4 + shadcn-ui + React Router 7
**Deploy:** Vercel (frontend) + Render (backend) + Supabase (DB) ✅ FUNCIONANDO
**Auth:** JWT HttpOnly cookies (sameSite:'lax' para Safari) + Discriminated unions

# Módulos Completados
✅ Auth (Admin): Login, logout, registro | ✅ ClientAuth: Sistema dual de autenticación  
✅ Services: CRUD público+admin | ✅ Availability: Bloques calendario | ✅ Booking: Reservas completas  
✅ Session Management: Context API con discriminated unions | ✅ Email Verification: Backend+Frontend+UX (100%)

